{"id":"d74493bfaf9bf48a","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-ordinal-arithmetic.md","title":"Ordinal Arithmetic","display":"df-ordinal-arithmetic — Ordinal Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ordinal-arithmetic","aliases":["58-df-ordinal-arithmetic","Ordinal Arithmetic"],"display":"df-ordinal-arithmetic — Ordinal Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-limitordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ordinal-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ordinal-arithmetic</span><span>Ordinal Arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ordinal-arithmetic — Ordinal Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal\">58-df-limitordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\lambda\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\lambda\\)</span> (ordinals, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ordinal}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span> (ordinal predicates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal\">58-df-limitordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+,\\cdot,{}^{(-)}\">\\(+,\\cdot,{}^{(-)}\\)</span> (ordinal operations defined by recursion below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}addition} \\vdash \\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\left(\\alpha+0=\\alpha\\land\\forall\\beta\\;(\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\to\\alpha+(\\beta+1)=(\\alpha+\\beta)\\cup\\{\\alpha+\\beta\\})\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;(\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\alpha+\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}(\\alpha+\\xi))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}addition} \\vdash \\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\left(\\alpha+0=\\alpha\\land\\forall\\beta\\;(\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\to\\alpha+(\\beta+1)=(\\alpha+\\beta)\\cup\\{\\alpha+\\beta\\})\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;(\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\alpha+\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}(\\alpha+\\xi))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}multiplication} \\vdash \\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\left(\\alpha\\cdot0=0\\land\\forall\\beta\\;(\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\to\\alpha\\cdot(\\beta+1)=\\alpha\\cdot\\beta+\\alpha)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;(\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\alpha\\cdot\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}(\\alpha\\cdot\\xi))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}multiplication} \\vdash \\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\left(\\alpha\\cdot0=0\\land\\forall\\beta\\;(\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\to\\alpha\\cdot(\\beta+1)=\\alpha\\cdot\\beta+\\alpha)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;(\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\alpha\\cdot\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}(\\alpha\\cdot\\xi))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}exponentiation} \\vdash \\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\left(\\alpha^0=1\\land\\forall\\beta\\;(\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\to\\alpha^{\\beta+1}=\\alpha^\\beta\\cdot\\alpha)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;(\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\alpha^\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}\\alpha^\\xi)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}exponentiation} \\vdash \\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\left(\\alpha^0=1\\land\\forall\\beta\\;(\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\to\\alpha^{\\beta+1}=\\alpha^\\beta\\cdot\\alpha)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;(\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\alpha^\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}\\alpha^\\xi)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>These are the transfinite-recursion clauses for ordinal addition, multiplication, and exponentiation in the right argument.</li>\n<li>All three operations are continuous at nonzero limit ordinals in the right argument; they are generally not commutative.</li>\n<li>Familiar identities such as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega+\\omega=\\omega\\cdot2\">\\(\\omega+\\omega=\\omega\\cdot2\\)</span> are consequences, not defining clauses.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory</li>\n<li>Kunen, Set Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-limitordinal","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-limitordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta,\\lambda$ (ordinals, see [[58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ordinal}$ and $\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S$ (ordinal predicates, see [[58-df-ordinal]] and [[58-df-limitordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-limitordinal","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ordinal}$ and $\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S$ (ordinal predicates, see [[58-df-ordinal]] and [[58-df-limitordinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta,\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"+,\\cdot,{}^{(-)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}addition} \\vdash \\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\left(\\alpha+0=\\alpha\\land\\forall\\beta\\;(\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\to\\alpha+(\\beta+1)=(\\alpha+\\beta)\\cup\\{\\alpha+\\beta\\})\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;(\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\alpha+\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\xi<\\lambda}(\\alpha+\\xi))\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}multiplication} \\vdash \\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\left(\\alpha\\cdot0=0\\land\\forall\\beta\\;(\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\to\\alpha\\cdot(\\beta+1)=\\alpha\\cdot\\beta+\\alpha)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;(\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\alpha\\cdot\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\xi<\\lambda}(\\alpha\\cdot\\xi))\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}exponentiation} \\vdash \\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\left(\\alpha^0=1\\land\\forall\\beta\\;(\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\to\\alpha^{\\beta+1}=\\alpha^\\beta\\cdot\\alpha)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;(\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\alpha^\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\xi<\\lambda}\\alpha^\\xi)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega+\\omega=\\omega\\cdot2","display":false}],"bytes":2030,"backlinks":[{"id":"74a4e3353b02c37d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\beta\\cdot\\gamma$ 使用 [[../batch15/58-df-ordinal-arithmetic.md]] 的序数乘法。"},{"id":"4510f856c7696c01","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8243b3b9c258446d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7da83dcdc2c9f158","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"60dfa07ff8dbb5b3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\cdot,+$ (ordinal multiplication and addition, see [[../batch15/58-df-ordinal-arithmetic.md]])"},{"id":"9952d6b6a8f8b771","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$+$ (ordinal addition, see [[58-df-ordinal-arithmetic]])"},{"id":"2e83eb34fc230e69","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$+$ and $\\cdot$ are ordinal addition and multiplication from [[58-df-ordinal-arithmetic]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-918","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-ordinal-arithmetic.md|58-df-ordinal-arithmetic]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["5582a281f15